  "readme": "The `tcp_chat` repository provides a multi-client chat system designed for users who need a Python-based messaging setup. It includes a server that manages unique user nicknames and broadcasts messages, alongside a command-line client for real-time communication. Powered by a custom line protocol with length-prefixed frames, the system also features a pytest suite to ensure reliable interaction across the entire network."
}

